**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!crates/**
!src/
!src/**
!static/
!static/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**
# Root build.rs drives tonic-build and proto/ holds the schema it compiles,
# so both must reach the build context or every image build fails.
!build.rs
!proto/
!proto/**
# Exclude local artifacts and credentials, including inside allowed folders.
**/target/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.dat
